 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・種: 夏が暑い地域では花後に葉が傷むことがあり、花茎を取って葉を刈り込み若返らせる（試作の 'Mourning Widow' と同じ文）。RHS・品種: 花後の茎と古葉を株元で切る。stauden.de: 秋に茎を切る",
  "management_type_quote": "Foliage may decline in hot summer climates after flowering, at which point flowering stems can be removed and foliage trimmed",
  "management_type_by_matching": "C 夏前切戻型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": "弱",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/種] 耐暑性；強\n[おぎはら 強・欧米 弱] おぎはら自身も楽天のページで蒸れ・暖地の日かげの注意を書いているので、中 にした\n[おぎはら楽天/種] 耐湿性: 普 通 ある程度耐えますが 高温多湿は嫌います（蒸れ 中 相当）\n[おぎはら楽天/種] 日照 寒冷地: 日向〜明るい日陰／暖地: 昼過ぎから半日陰が理想（西日 △ 相当）\n[MBG/種] Intolerant of the heat and humidity of the deep South.\n[MBG/種] Foliage may decline in hot summer climates after flowering, at which point flowering stems can be removed and foliage trimmed both to shape and revitalize plants.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（種の記述）は 弱 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or East-facing or North-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 1／MBG・種] some self-seeding may occur（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・種] If not deadheaded, some self-seeding may occur in ideal growing conditions.\n[地下茎 1／MBG・種] Noteworthy Characteristics Geranium phaeum is a tall, rhizomatous, clump-forming perennial with branching stems which typically grows 18-30\" tall with a spread of 12-18\".\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] 地下茎：言い回しの照合では 1、文を読み直して 空欄（記述なし）\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち、地下茎）",
  "mixing_evidence": "[読み直し 2026-11-24] 株立ちの記述だけで、広がる記述がない：[MBG・種] rhizomatous, clump-forming",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[RHS・品種] Habit: Columnar upright",
